  "content": "<h2><span class=\"nolink\">Nadeshiko</span></h2><p data-pid=\"D11nGORy\">超好用的日本动画句子数据库，很适合用来找例句：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//nadeshiko.co/ja\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Nadeshiko：アニメ・ドラマ・YouTubeの日本語例文を検索</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a08515d8bea37a655355ad08dfe74662_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2244\" data-rawheight=\"2278\" data-original-token=\"v2-a08515d8bea37a655355ad08dfe74662\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2244\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-a08515d8bea37a655355ad08dfe74662_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2244&#39; height=&#39;2278&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2244\" data-rawheight=\"2278\" data-original-token=\"v2-a08515d8bea37a655355ad08dfe74662\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2244\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-a08515d8bea37a655355ad08dfe74662_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a08515d8bea37a655355ad08dfe74662_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Jiten.Moe</h2><p data-pid=\"oo0yflsA\">超好用的日语沉浸材料数据库，适合用来找匹配自己当前水平的日本动画、小说、漫画、Galgame、电视剧：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//jiten.moe/decks/media\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Media decks - Jiten</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2b9bd64afee6d3af0b640a5401103d5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1834\" data-rawheight=\"2324\" data-original-token=\"v2-2b9bd64afee6d3af0b640a5401103d5c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1834\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2b9bd64afee6d3af0b640a5401103d5c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1834&#39; height=&#39;2324&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1834\" data-rawheight=\"2324\" data-original-token=\"v2-2b9bd64afee6d3af0b640a5401103d5c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1834\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2b9bd64afee6d3af0b640a5401103d5c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2b9bd64afee6d3af0b640a5401103d5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Katsuyo Dojo</h2><p data-pid=\"n-GkjpW_\">我基于日语语法指南 <a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/90446\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_gallery\" class=\"internal\">Yokubi 中文版</a> vibe 的日语活用练习网站：<a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/30590\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_gallery\" class=\"internal\">活用道场</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-111ba9db0e4c1a18c9de66366e432487_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2398\" data-rawheight=\"2284\" data-original-token=\"v2-111ba9db0e4c1a18c9de66366e432487\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2398\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-111ba9db0e4c1a18c9de66366e432487_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2398&#39; height=&#39;2284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2398\" data-rawheight=\"2284\" data-original-token=\"v2-111ba9db0e4c1a18c9de66366e432487\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2398\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-111ba9db0e4c1a18c9de66366e432487_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-111ba9db0e4c1a18c9de66366e432487_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Kanabr</h2><p data-pid=\"FsHPTII_\">我基于 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//keybr.com/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">keybr.com</a> vibe 的日语平假名/片假名自适应罗马字打字训练网站：<a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/30575\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_gallery\" class=\"internal\">kanabr</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c6f21c9b3339cf4d242f14dbd306d27_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2872\" data-rawheight=\"1516\" data-original-token=\"v2-9c6f21c9b3339cf4d242f14dbd306d27\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2872\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-9c6f21c9b3339cf4d242f14dbd306d27_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2872&#39; height=&#39;1516&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2872\" data-rawheight=\"1516\" data-original-token=\"v2-9c6f21c9b3339cf4d242f14dbd306d27\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2872\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-9c6f21c9b3339cf4d242f14dbd306d27_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c6f21c9b3339cf4d242f14dbd306d27_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Koku</h2><p data-pid=\"Rmvdvyx3\">日语音调学习网站，可以帮初学者练习辨别日语的音调：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//kotu.io/tests/ja/pitchAccent/perception/minimalPairs\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Test Details | Kotu</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-91b0344cd1d6a3e4478c2fadf61ab54a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2374\" data-rawheight=\"2634\" data-original-token=\"v2-91b0344cd1d6a3e4478c2fadf61ab54a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2374\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-91b0344cd1d6a3e4478c2fadf61ab54a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2374&#39; height=&#39;2634&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2374\" data-rawheight=\"2634\" data-original-token=\"v2-91b0344cd1d6a3e4478c2fadf61ab54a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2374\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-91b0344cd1d6a3e4478c2fadf61ab54a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-91b0344cd1d6a3e4478c2fadf61ab54a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>TheMoeWay</h2><p data-pid=\"2dnPDZKc\">一个以<b>沉浸式学习</b>为核心的日语学习社区和方法论， <a class=\"member_mention\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" data-hash=\"4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\">@Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组翻译了上面大部分指南：<a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005777505055967011\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\"internal\">日语学习：萌萌二次元之路 - 知乎</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d069fcf92a6af61531cb18eac6d755fa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2400\" data-rawheight=\"2290\" data-original-token=\"v2-d069fcf92a6af61531cb18eac6d755fa\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2400\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-d069fcf92a6af61531cb18eac6d755fa_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2400&#39; height=&#39;2290&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2400\" data-rawheight=\"2290\" data-original-token=\"v2-d069fcf92a6af61531cb18eac6d755fa\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2400\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-d069fcf92a6af61531cb18eac6d755fa_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d069fcf92a6af61531cb18eac6d755fa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Asbplayer</h2><p data-pid=\"tOYEVD1a\">一个主要用于在线流媒体的视频播放工具。它可以接管 Netflix、YouTube 等主流流媒体平台以及本地视频的字幕层，让你在看动画、电视剧或电影时，直接配合 Yomitan 查词，并将生词、对应画面、例句台词和该句音频一并制卡：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//app.asbplayer.dev/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">asbplayer</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a777e86cf24d42f16eae3d2d886047c8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"5060\" data-rawheight=\"2644\" data-original-token=\"v2-a777e86cf24d42f16eae3d2d886047c8\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"5060\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a777e86cf24d42f16eae3d2d886047c8_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;5060&#39; height=&#39;2644&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"5060\" data-rawheight=\"2644\" data-original-token=\"v2-a777e86cf24d42f16eae3d2d886047c8\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"5060\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a777e86cf24d42f16eae3d2d886047c8_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a777e86cf24d42f16eae3d2d886047c8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Jimaku</h2><p data-pid=\"r7x5N-KI\">一个用来找日本动漫日语字幕的网站：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//jimaku.cc/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Jimaku</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-36275b89f2249c11cef387e13bd31890_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2540\" data-rawheight=\"1180\" data-original-token=\"v2-36275b89f2249c11cef387e13bd31890\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2540\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-36275b89f2249c11cef387e13bd31890_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2540&#39; height=&#39;1180&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2540\" data-rawheight=\"1180\" data-original-token=\"v2-36275b89f2249c11cef387e13bd31890\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2540\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-36275b89f2249c11cef387e13bd31890_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-36275b89f2249c11cef387e13bd31890_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Nyaa</h2><p data-pid=\"klJwYC-P\">世界上最大的日本资源盗版网站，覆盖所有类型（小说类较少）：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//nyaa.si/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Browse :: Nyaa</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-80f1bbea1da645911b3f50874c721160_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2354\" data-rawheight=\"1482\" data-original-token=\"v2-80f1bbea1da645911b3f50874c721160\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2354\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-80f1bbea1da645911b3f50874c721160_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2354&#39; height=&#39;1482&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2354\" data-rawheight=\"1482\" data-original-token=\"v2-80f1bbea1da645911b3f50874c721160\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2354\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-80f1bbea1da645911b3f50874c721160_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-80f1bbea1da645911b3f50874c721160_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南</h2><p data-pid=\"yfsJVwE3\">中文日语沉浸学习圈最全面的日语学习指南：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">⁠‌​​‍​﻿​‬​‍​﻿​​​​​​‌​​﻿​⁠⁠​​​​‍​‍​⁠‬​​​​‬​​基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-282a9016d3ab210d3f42ba0bc1e47be3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2364\" data-rawheight=\"2640\" data-original-token=\"v2-282a9016d3ab210d3f42ba0bc1e47be3\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2364\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-282a9016d3ab210d3f42ba0bc1e47be3_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2364&#39; height=&#39;2640&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2364\" data-rawheight=\"2640\" data-original-token=\"v2-282a9016d3ab210d3f42ba0bc1e47be3\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2364\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-282a9016d3ab210d3f42ba0bc1e47be3_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-282a9016d3ab210d3f42ba0bc1e47be3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p></p>",
